# \`@minecraft/generic-fixtures\` Changelog

## Version Changes
- [1.1.0](#110)
- [1.0.0](#100)

## 1.1.0
#### Changed *[\`FixtureRegistry\`](FixtureRegistry.md)*
- Changed function *[\`select\`](FixtureRegistry.md#select)*
  - Changed generic type parameters from &lt;TItem extends [*BaseFixture*](BaseFixture.md)&gt; to &lt;TItem extends [*@minecraft/generic-base.CrossModuleBase*](../../../scriptapi/minecraft/generic-base/CrossModuleBase.md)&gt;
#### Changed *[\`GenericDerived\`](GenericDerived.md)*
- Changed generic type parameters from &lt;TAlpha, TZebra&gt; to &lt;TZebra, TAlpha&gt;
- Added base class [*@minecraft/generic-base.GenericBase*](../../../scriptapi/minecraft/generic-base/GenericBase.md)&lt;*TAlpha*, *TZebra*&gt;
- Removed base class *GenericBase<TZebra, TAlpha>*
#### Changed *[\`GenericFixture\`](GenericFixture.md)*
- Changed generic type parameters from &lt;TZebra extends [*@minecraft/generic-base.CrossModuleBase*](../../../scriptapi/minecraft/generic-base/CrossModuleBase.md), TAlpha = *boolean*&gt; to &lt;TZebra extends [*@minecraft/generic-base.CrossModuleBase*](../../../scriptapi/minecraft/generic-base/CrossModuleBase.md), TAlpha = *string*&gt;
#### Added *[\`GenericApplicationInterface\`](GenericApplicationInterface.md)*
#### Changed *[\`GenericInterface\`](GenericInterface.md)*
- Changed generic type parameters from &lt;TAlpha, TZebra&gt; to &lt;TZebra, TAlpha&gt;
#### Changed function *[\`convert\`](GenericInterface.md#convert)*
- Changed generic type parameters from &lt;TAlpha, TZebra&gt; to &lt;TZebra, TAlpha&gt;
#### Changed function *[\`getCurrent\`](GenericInterface.md#getcurrent)*
- Changed return type from *TAlpha* to *TAlpha*[]
#### Added *[\`GenericPropertyInterface\`](GenericPropertyInterface.md)*
#### Changed function \`pick\`
- Changed generic type parameters from &lt;TAlpha, TZebra&gt; to &lt;TZebra, TAlpha&gt;
## 1.0.0
#### Added \`@minecraft/generic-fixtures\` Module
"
`;

